  hintIngredientsMore: Tap Look it up to retry the Firebase and trusted-source search.
  hintCodes: Show the barcode (on the bottom or the back)
  hintShade: Show the shade's name or number
  hintAround: Show one clear view of the product. No extra angles are needed.
  hintAllDone: Product recognized.
  hintBrand: 'The brand is not read yet: show the brand name on the front'
  hintName: 'Now the product''s name: hold the front steady, with the name inside
