  similarTitle: Is it one of these?
  similarMessage: We read the name and the brand but not the kind of make-up or the
    shade. Tap the product if it is one of these, for a faster and surer result.
  similarNoneLabel: None of these
  msgNoSimilar: No similar product is saved. Try scanning again, or tap Finish to
    go on with what was read.
  msgNotSure: We could not name this product. Type its name, start over, or tap Finish
